{"unit_id":"tag:06EN:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>本节定义代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）性质是源局部的（local on the source）的含义。请与《下降（Descent）》的节<REF_0001>比较。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"章节名称，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06EP:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphisms）性质，这些态射的源和目标为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。设<MATH_0004>。我们称<MATH_0005>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006>源局部的（local on the source）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或者<TEXTITOPEN_0002>对如下拓扑源局部的（local on the source for the）<MATH_0007>-拓扑（topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对于任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>（其源和目标为<MATH_0009>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）），以及任意<MATH_0010>-覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>（由代数空间（algebraic spaces）构成），我们有<MATHSEG_0001> 具有 <MATHSEG_0002>每个 <MATHSEG_0003> 具有 <MATHSEG_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的"},{"source_term":"local on the source for the","target_term":"对如下拓扑源局部的"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source for the","target_term":"对如下拓扑源局部的","context":"特定拓扑下的源局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"拓扑类型，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06EN:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>确实，由于同构（isomorphisms）总是覆盖（coverings），可知（或要求）性质<MATH_0001>对<MATH_0002>成立，当且仅当它对任意箭头（arrow）<MATH_0003>成立，其中该箭头与<MATH_0004>同构（isomorphic）。若一个性质是<MATH_0005>-源局部的（local on the source），则预复合（precomposing）出现于<MATH_0006>-覆盖（coverings）中的态射（morphisms）会保持此性质。以下是一个形式化陈述。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"预复合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖，待决。"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"范畴映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"箭头之间的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"预复合","context":"复合运算，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06EQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是一个态射（morphisms）性质，这些态射的源和目标为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），并且该性质是<MATH_0005>源局部的（local on the source）。设<MATH_0006>具有性质<MATH_0007>。对于任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，若它是平坦的（flat），相应地<SPACE_0001>平坦的（flat）且局部有限表现的（locally of finite presentation），相应地<SPACE_0002>综平的（syntomic），相应地<SPACE_0003>光滑的（smooth），相应地<SPACE_0004>平展的（<ACCENT_0001>tale），则复合（composition）<MATH_0009>具有性质<MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现的"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展的"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平的","context":"态射性质，暂定译名。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"运算，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
